# Mid Red log: the standing rules fix (storytime_cover_options_20261106)

Role: measure-mid-red. Model: minimax-cn-coding-plan/MiniMax-M3.1-Flash. Date: 2026-11-11.
Role base: `f6278c57`. Phase: P2, Phase 2: The option A covers.
The Thai filter was the first command: it counted 0 Thai characters in the 2 files of the scope.

## The defect

The orchestrator review of commit `105fc317` found one test defect. S4 (a) measured the across
centre of the A3 `role-bar` from the label text alone. The role bar holds 2 role icons left of the
label. B7 of `quest-cover-readers-r2b.test.ts` pins even paddings around the icons and the label.
The label alone therefore stands about 8 mm right of the bar centre. S4 and B7 could not pass
together.

## The fix

The role bar text block is the role mark: the 2 icons and the label. The PM rule 4 reads "each
text block is centered within 1 mm".

`measurePage` now also measures the boxes of the role icon spans of the `role-bar` part, the
`span` elements of the role mark that hold an `svg`, as the footer icons are measured. S4 (a)
builds the union of the label ink box and the icon boxes for the `role-bar` part. The across
centre, the down centre, and the inside-the-part-box check use that union. Every other part keeps
its present measure. The file changes no production code.

## The gates

The standing-rules file alone exits 1: `Tests 3 failed | 2 passed (5)`. The failing tests are S3,
S4, and S5. S1 and S2 pass. S4 fails on 26 pages, from 30. No role bar line remains in S4. The 14
role bar lines of S3 stay: the cap height is 3.70 mm of the 10.80 mm band, 34.3 %. The reader-a3
S4 down failures now come only from the title plaque, 2.77 mm to 3.30 mm.

The tsc gate exits 0. The lint gate exits 0 with no output. Each capture holds 0 Thai lines.
`pnpm-lock.yaml` is unchanged.

The captures: `red-standing-rules-fix.txt`, `red-standing-rules-fix-tsc.txt`,
`red-standing-rules-fix-lint.txt`.

